  "visual_differences": {
    "shared": "The native HUD and panels use their existing font metrics, tracking, bar fills, outlines, opacity and corner radii. This changes small text, button width, spacing and panel edges. The capture runs on Thursday day 8 at 10:00. The pictured coins and trust, dialogue, conditions, and order match.",
    "t01": "The live map has marker rings, outlined labels and live gate and street geometry. The two toolbar rows and the canal caption are spaced differently. Talk to Salma follows Read the board and the oven action.",
    "t02–t06": "Live placeholder square, oven, player and Salma replace the prototype market backdrop. The greeted label and adjacent controls have small spacing differences in t03 and t04.",
    "t07–t08": "Live Spice row and the player and Rashid capsules replace the reused prototype market backdrop. Rashid's name appears above the panel at right.",
    "t09–t10": "Live Weaver’s lane has plain greybox walls and visible capsules. The lane name uses the existing place data's typographic apostrophe.",
    "t11–t12": "Live 10:00 daylight at the Quay, with the named Jamal capsule and canal. The prototype frames show a moonlit quay with the same 10:00 HUD.",
    "t13–t14": "Live Market scales backdrop and the large nearby Old Musa capsule and label replace the reused market backdrop.",
    "t15": "The live square and capsules show behind the reputation panel. The existing line, source, tone and footer layout has different spacing and button widths."
